## 7. Action Plan for a Complete Beginner
```markdown
Day 1: Create a Vapi.ai account and deploy the starter template.
Day 2: Buy a Twilio number and connect it to the Vapi agent.
Day 3: Write a dental clinic appointment-booking dialogue script.
Day 4: Record the AI call demo.
Day 5: Send the demo recording to 10 local dental clinic owners via email or Instagram DM.
```

